1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,130
Narrator：Listen to an English teacher talking to students.

2
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:08,476
Teacher：I realize that many of you like to play video games,

3
00:00:08,476 --> 00:00:11,230
so I want you to think about what would make the best game.

4
00:00:11,230 --> 00:00:16,329
Then I want you to create your own game in a writing piece, complete

5
00:00:16,329 --> 00:00:19,120
with a story, characters, and setting.

6
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:23,160
The purpose of this assignment is to make you think creatively.

7
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,618
There's one rule:

8
00:00:24,618 --> 00:00:28,000
your game cannot be violent.
